  "description": "The illegitimate son of Duke Blauke, Theodore, who had long lived a wandering life away from home, only returns to the family estate after his father’s death and his half-brother Bernhard inherits the title. There, he hears rumors that a “ghost haunts the annex.”\n\n*“That thing I saw back then… it wasn’t just a dream!”*\n\nDetermined to uncover the identity of the ghost he encountered as a child, Theodore enters the room, only to come face-to-face with the so-called “ghost.” But Bernhard’s own reaction to it seems far from ordinary…\n\nThus begins the story of two brothers vying for the heart of the ghost in the annex.\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/ghostinthe)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/ghostinthe), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.jp/comic/ghostinthe)",
